    "If saving fails, keep this window open and use Export and recovery to capture its unsaved drafts. Other windows and open Font Studio drawings must be exported from their own window.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wenn das Speichern fehlschlägt, lassen Sie dieses Fenster offen und sichern Sie seine ungespeicherten Entwürfe unter Export und Wiederherstellung. Entwürfe anderer Fenster und offene Font-Studio-Zeichnungen müssen im jeweiligen Fenster exportiert werden."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "If saving fails, keep this window open and use Export and recovery to capture its unsaved drafts. Other windows and open Font Studio drawings must be exported from their own window."
