    "The iCloud account changed. Previous notes and drafts remain on this device. Choose an account explicitly before transferring again.": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Das iCloud-Konto hat sich geändert. Bisherige Notizen und Entwürfe bleiben auf diesem Gerät. Wähle vor einer erneuten Übertragung ausdrücklich ein Konto."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The iCloud account changed. Previous notes and drafts remain on this device. Choose an account explicitly before transferring again."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The original library could not be opened. It will remain untouched. Inspect a notebook package to recover into a separate local library.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Die ursprüngliche Bibliothek konnte nicht geöffnet werden. Sie bleibt unverändert. Prüfe ein Notizbuchpaket zur Wiederherstellung in einer separaten lokalen Bibliothek."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The original library could not be opened. It will remain untouched. Inspect a notebook package to recover into a separate local library."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The selected library was reopened after an interrupted switch. Both libraries were kept; transfer remains stopped.": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Die ausgewählte Bibliothek wurde nach einem unterbrochenen Wechsel erneut geöffnet. Beide Bibliotheken bleiben erhalten; die Übertragung bleibt gestoppt."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The selected library was reopened after an interrupted switch. Both libraries were kept; transfer remains stopped."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The shared file is protected while your device is locked. Already rendered widget previews may remain in system caches, including after locking or turning previews off. Refresh timing is controlled by the system.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Die gemeinsame Datei ist bei gesperrtem Gerät geschützt. Bereits dargestellte Widget-Vorschauen können im System-Cache verbleiben, auch nach dem Sperren oder Ausschalten der Vorschau. Den Aktualisierungszeitpunkt bestimmt das System."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The shared file is protected while your device is locked. Already rendered widget previews may remain in system caches, including after locking or turning previews off. Refresh timing is controlled by the system."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The text is too tall for this ruling. Choose a smaller size; your draft was kept.": {
